  "Number": 15,
  "Question": "Sale prices at the Ajax Outlet Store are \\(50\\%\\) below original prices. On Saturdays an additional discount of \\(20\\%\\) off the sale price is given. What is the Saturday price of a coat whose original price is \\(\\$180?\\)",
  "Question Type": "text",
  "Choices": {
    "A": "\\(\\$54\\)",
    "B": "\\(\\$72\\)",
    "C": "\\(\\$90\\)",
    "D": "\\(\\$108\\)",
    "E": "\\(\\$110\\)"
  },
  "Choices Type": "text",
  "Correct Answer": "B",
  "Solution": "The Saturday discount applies to the sale price, so calculate that price first. A \\(50\\%\\) reduction leaves \\(50\\%\\) of the original price:\n\\[\n180\\times0.50=90.\n\\]\nThe additional \\(20\\%\\) reduction leaves \\(80\\%\\) of this \\(\\$90\\) sale price:\n\\[\n90\\times0.80=72.\n\\]\nThe Saturday price is \\(\\$72\\), choice \\(\\mathrm{B}\\).",
